  <template v-else-if="place">
  <view class="detail-breadcrumb"><ActionButton class="text-button" @click="back"><AppIcon name="arrow-left"/> 探索上海</ActionButton><text>{{place.district}} / {{place.type}} / {{place.demo?'演示地点':place.discovery?'真实地点 · 待核实':'社区收录'}}</text></view><view class="detail-header"><view><view class="headline detail-title">{{place.name}}</view><view class="description">{{place.zones.length?place.zones.map(z=>zoneLabels[z]).join(' · '):place.observations?.zones?'未设专门分区':'工作分区待确认'}}</view></view><view class="chips"><ActionButton class="outline-button" @click="share">分享 <AppIcon name="arrow-up-right"/></ActionButton><ActionButton class="outline-button" :aria-pressed="saved.includes(place.id)" @click="save(place.id)"><AppIcon name="heart"/>{{saved.includes(place.id)?'已收藏':'收藏'}}</ActionButton></view></view><view class="detail-visual"><view class="hero"><image :src="'/static/room-'+place.drawing+'.svg'" mode="aspectFit"/><view class="hero-caption">{{place.demo?'空间与条件均为虚构演示':'空间示意插画，非地点实景'}}</view></view><view class="visual-caption"><image src="/static/brand/logo-icon.png" mode="aspectFit"/><view>坐下来，<text class="line-break"> </text>让事情发生。</view><text>Find your seat.<text class="line-break"> </text>Find your flow.</text></view></view>
