<view v-if="detailTab==='essentials'" id="essentials" class="section content-panel" role="tabpanel"><view class="section-title">开工需要的，这里都有吗？</view><view class="baseline"><text>{{place.discovery?'○':'✓'}}</text><view><view>{{place.discovery?'电脑办公条件待核实':'欢迎使用笔记本电脑'}}</view><text>{{place.discovery?'已匹配真实名称、地址和坐标；尚未确认办公许可与桌面条件。':'桌面能放下电脑与鼠标，是收录的基本条件。'}}</text></view></view><view v-if="!place.demo" class="contribution-prompt"><view><view class="amenity-title">来过这里？补充一项就好。</view><view class="meta">选插座、椅子或办公规则，审核后帮助下一位。</view></view><ActionButton class="outline-button" @click="showDialog('supplement')">补充一项 <AppIcon name="plus"/></ActionButton></view><view class="amenities"><view class="amenity"><image src="/static/plug.svg"/><view><view class="amenity-title">插座 {{place.plugs}}</view><view class="meta">{{place.charging}}</view></view></view><view class="amenity"><image src="/static/chair.svg"/><view><view class="amenity-title">{{place.chair}}</view><view class="meta">{{place.chairNote}}</view></view></view><ActionButton class="amenity clickable" :disabled="!place.wifi" @click="place.demo?(wifiOpen=true):notify('暂未取得允许公开的连接信息，请到店确认')"><image src="/static/wifi.svg"/><view><view class="amenity-title">{{place.wifi?(place.demo?'Wi-Fi 连接信息 ↗':'提供 Wi-Fi'):place.wifi===false?'无 Wi-Fi':'Wi-Fi 待确认'}}</view><view class="meta">{{place.wifi?(place.demo?'打开并复制连接信息':'连接方式请到店确认'):'暂无可用连接资料'}}</view></view></ActionButton><view class="amenity"><image src="/static/zones.svg"/><view><view class="amenity-title">工作区域</view><view class="zone-tags"><text v-if="!place.zones.length">工作区域待确认</text><text v-for="z in place.zones" :key="z">{{zoneLabels[z]}}</text></view></view></view></view></view><view v-if="(facts?.menu.length||facts?.menuUrl)&&detailTab==='menu'" id="menu" class="section content-panel" role="tabpanel"><view class="row"><view class="section-title">{{place.type==='咖啡馆'?'喝点什么，再开始。':'选一个适合的时长。'}}</view><ActionButton class="underlink" @click="showDialog('menu')">{{place.type==='咖啡馆'?'查看菜单':'查看价目'}}</ActionButton></view><view class="menu-preview"><view v-for="item in facts.menu.slice(0,2)" :key="item.name"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.price}}</text></view></view><view class="meta">{{place.demo?'演示价格 · 非商家报价。':'商家公开菜单 · 价格可能调整，以现场为准。'}}</view></view>
<view v-if="detailTab==='sources'" class="section content-panel" role="tabpanel"><view class="section-title">每个判断，都有来处。</view><view class="description">来源说明了什么、何时核对，与你的出行同样重要。商家自述不等于独立实测。</view><view v-if="place.demo" class="notice">这是虚构地点，没有真实核实依据。</view><view v-for="source in place.leadSources||[]" :key="source.url" class="evidence-row"><view class="amenity-title">{{source.kind}} · 地点发现线索</view><view class="description">{{source.note}}</view><view class="meta">整理于 {{source.checkedAt}} · 不代表实访认证</view><ActionButton class="underlink" @click="openMenu(source.url)">查看线索来源 <AppIcon name="arrow-up-right"/></ActionButton></view><view v-for="field in coreFields" :key="field.key" class="evidence-row"><view class="row"><text class="amenity-title">{{field.label}}</text><text class="status-chip" :class="place.evidence?.[field.key]&&evidenceFresh(place.evidence[field.key]!.date)?'tone-free':'tone-unknown'">{{place.evidence?.[field.key]?(evidenceFresh(place.evidence[field.key]!.date)?'近期核对':'需重新核对'):'待补依据'}}</text></view><template v-if="place.evidence?.[field.key]"><view class="description">{{place.evidence[field.key]!.note}}</view><view class="meta">{{evidenceKinds[place.evidence[field.key]!.kind]}} · 核对于 {{place.evidence[field.key]!.date}}</view><ActionButton v-if="place.evidence[field.key]!.url" class="underlink" @click="openMenu(place.evidence[field.key]!.url)">查看来源 <AppIcon name="arrow-up-right"/></ActionButton></template><view v-if="place.confirmations?.[field.key]" class="notice"><view>社区到访核对 · {{place.confirmations[field.key]!.date}}</view><view>{{place.confirmations[field.key]!.note}}</view><view class="meta">用户自述，经审核展示；不替代上方来源与规则。</view></view></view><view v-if="place.merchant" class="notice merchant-statement"><view>商家自述 · {{place.merchant.date}} · {{place.merchant.contact}}</view><view>确认了：{{place.merchant.fields.map(f=>merchantLabels[f]||f).join('、')}}</view><view v-if="place.merchant.note">{{place.merchant.note}}</view><view class="meta">由场地方通过确认链接提交，经审核展示；不等于独立实测，以现场为准。</view></view><view v-if="place.observations" class="observation-list"><view v-for="(observation,key) in place.observations" :key="key" class="evidence-row"><view class="row"><text>{{supplementLabels[key]||key}} · {{supplementValue(observation.value)}}</text><text class="meta">{{observation.date}}</text></view><view class="description">{{observation.note}}</view><view class="meta">社区到访补充 · 经审核展示</view><ActionButton v-if="observation.sourceUrl" class="underlink" @click="openMenu(observation.sourceUrl)">查看补充来源</ActionButton></view></view><view class="chips evidence-actions"><ActionButton v-if="session&&!place.demo&&!place.discovery" class="outline-button" @click="showDialog('confirm')">我刚到访，核对信息</ActionButton><ActionButton class="outline-button" @click="showDialog('report')">发现信息变化，告诉我们 <AppIcon name="arrow-up-right"/></ActionButton></view></view>
<view v-if="detailTab==='parking'" class="section content-panel" role="tabpanel"><view class="section-title">开车来，先看看附近。</view><view class="description">500 米内停车候选。距离按直线计算，车行入口、访客权限与收费需另行核对。</view><view v-if="parkingState==='loading'" class="parking-skeleton" aria-live="polite">正在查找附近停车场…</view><view v-else-if="parkingState==='demo'" class="notice">虚构地点没有真实停车信息。正式收录并提供坐标后可查询。</view><view v-else-if="parkingState==='no-location'" class="notice">地点坐标待核对，暂不能准确查询附近停车场。</view><view v-else-if="parkingState==='unconfigured'" class="notice">停车查询暂未开放。</view><view v-else-if="parkingState==='error'" class="notice">{{parkingError}}<ActionButton class="underlink" @click="loadParking">重新查询</ActionButton></view><view v-else-if="!parking.length" class="empty-note">暂未找到停车候选，不代表附近没有停车设施。</view><view v-for="lot in parking" :key="lot.id" class="parking-card"><view class="row"><view class="amenity-title">{{lot.name}}</view><text class="parking-distance">{{lot.distanceMeters}} m</text></view><view class="meta">{{lot.address}} · 直线距离</view><view class="chips"><text class="status-chip tone-unknown">{{lot.access==='internal'?'标注内部 · 需确认访客权限':'访客权限待确认'}}</text><text class="meta">收费待确认 · 余位未知</text></view><ActionButton class="underlink" @click="openLocation(lot)">查看停车候选位置 <AppIcon name="arrow-up-right"/></ActionButton></view><view v-if="parking.length" class="notice">来源：腾讯位置服务。这里展示的是候选位置，不是已核实车行入口；地图记录也不保证可停。</view></view>
<view v-if="detailTab==='rules'" id="rules" class="section content-panel" role="tabpanel"><view class="section-title">坐下来之前。</view><view v-for="row in [{label:'开放时间',value:place.hours},{label:'进入方式',value:place.entry},{label:'停留规则',value:place.stay}]" :key="row.label" class="info-row"><text>{{row.label}}</text><text>{{row.value}}</text></view><view class="extras"><text v-for="x in place.extras" :key="x">{{x}}</text></view></view><view v-if="detailTab==='community'" id="community" class="section content-panel" role="tabpanel"><view class="row"><view class="section-title">在这里，工作得怎么样？</view><ActionButton class="underlink" @click="showDialog('visit')">写体验 <AppIcon name="arrow-up-right"/></ActionButton></view><view class="muted">到访时段、实际花费和办公体验，比一个笼统评分更有用。</view><view class="notice">{{place.demo?'示例体验仅存于本机，不会作为真实社区内容公开。':'体验保存到云端，审核后展示署名；待审核内容仅自己和审核员可见。'}}</view><view v-if="!feedback.visits.length" class="empty-note">还没有体验记录，留下你的第一次到访。</view><view v-for="v in feedback.visits" :key="v.id" class="review"><view class="row"><view><view class="amenity-title">{{place.demo?'你 · 本机记录':(v.authorName||'社区贡献者')+(v.pending?' · 待审核':'')}}</view><view class="meta">{{v.date}} · {{v.period}}到访{{v.spend?' · 实付 ¥'+v.spend:''}}</view></view><text class="review-avatar">{{place.demo||v.own?'你':(v.authorName||'友').slice(0,1)}}</text></view><view class="review-copy">{{v.text}}</view><ActionButton v-if="place.demo||(!v.own&&!v.pending)" class="underlink" @click="useful(v.id)">{{feedback.helpful.includes(v.id)?'已标记有帮助':'有帮助'}}{{!place.demo&&v.helps?' · '+v.helps:''}}</ActionButton></view></view></view><view class="aside"><view class="price-box"><view class="row"><view class="kicker">这次到访</view><text class="cost-tag" :class="'tone-'+place.cost">{{costLabels[place.cost]}}</text></view><view class="price-title">{{facts?.budget}}</view><view class="description">{{facts?.basis}}</view><view class="meta">{{place.demo?'演示预算，非商家报价':'预算按来源估算，请以现场规则为准'}}</view><view class="divider"/><view class="row"><view><view class="amenity-title" :class="seat?'seat-'+seat.status:''">{{seat?seatLabels[seat.status]:'当前空位待确认'}}</view><view class="meta">{{seat?(place.demo?'本机演示反馈 · ':'社区到访反馈 · ')+Math.floor((clock-seat.at)/60000)+' 分钟前':'暂无近期到访反馈'}}</view></view><text class="seat-dot" :class="seat?'seat-'+seat.status:'tone-unknown'">◉</text></view><view class="meta">反馈仅参考 1 小时，不保证到店有座。</view><ActionButton class="black-button" @click="showDialog('seat')">我在这里，更新空位</ActionButton><ActionButton v-if="(facts?.menu.length||facts?.menuUrl)" class="outline-button" @click="showDialog('menu')">{{place.type==='咖啡馆'?'查看菜单与价格':'查看价目与权益'}}</ActionButton><ActionButton v-if="!place.demo" class="outline-button" @click="openLocation(place)">{{place.location?'在高德查看地点':'在高德搜索地址'}}</ActionButton><view v-if="!place.demo" class="meta">{{place.location?'已提供地图坐标，出发前请核对入口':'坐标待核对，搜索结果请确认同名门店'}}</view><view class="tiny">{{place.demo?'演示地点，无实际导航':place.address}}</view><view v-if="!place.demo&&place.sourceUrl" class="source-note"><text>由 {{place.contributor}} 贡献 · 资料日期 {{place.sourceDate}}<text v-if="place.poiSource"> · {{place.poiSource}}</text></text><ActionButton class="underlink" @click="openMenu(place.sourceUrl)">查看信息来源 <AppIcon name="arrow-up-right"/></ActionButton></view><view v-if="closureCount" class="notice tone-unknown">{{closureCount}} 份怀疑闭店反馈，出发前请再次核对。</view></view><view class="report-entry"><ActionButton class="underlink" @click="showDialog('report')">⚑ {{feedback.report?'查看 / 修改信息纠错':'报告地点信息问题'}}</ActionButton><view v-if="feedback.report" class="meta">{{feedback.report.reason}} · 本机记录</view></view><view class="laptop-note"><view class="kicker">Laptop friendly</view><view class="muted">通过办公核实需要确认电脑许可、桌面、费用和开放时间。待核实地点请先确认再出发。</view></view></view></view>
